**🌌 Cosmic Clash: Space Gesture Battle**

A futuristic hand-gesture game built using Python, OpenCV, and MediaPipe where players battle against a Cosmic AI using space powers instead of traditional Rock-Paper-Scissors.
Control the game using real-time hand gestures through your webcam and enter an interstellar showdown of Stars, Comets, and Black Holes.

**🚀 Features**
 - Real-time hand gesture detection
 - Space-themed gameplay
 - AI opponent with random cosmic moves
 - Animated starfield background
 - Live score tracking
 - Round timer system
 - Futuristic UI using OpenCV

**🪐 Cosmic Powers**
Gesture	and their Cosmic Power
✊ Closed Fist -	BLACK HOLE
✌ Two Fingers	- COMET
✋ Open Hand	- STAR

**⚔️ Battle Rules**
 - STAR defeats COMET
 - COMET defeats BLACK HOLE
 - BLACK HOLE defeats STAR

**🛠️ Tech Stack**
 - Python
 - penCV
 - MediaPipe
 - NumPy

**📦 Installation**
Clone the repository: git clone https://github.com/your-username/Cosmic-Clash-AI.git
Move into the project folder: cd Cosmic-Clash-AI
Install dependencies: pip install opencv-python mediapipe numpy

**Run the Project**
python cosmic_clash.py
Press: Q to exit the game.

**📸 Gameplay**
 - Webcam tracks your hand gestures
 - AI selects a random cosmic power
 - Winner is decided instantly
 - Scores update in real time

**🌠 Future Improvements**
